164 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Hey\054 hey\054 hey\056\056\056 They really can\220t know I\220m writing this\056 I mean\054 it counts at the\nleast as treason and breach of protocol\054 but after the work you\220ve been doing\nover the past 4 days with these random anomalies and updates\054 you deserve \nthe truth\054 even if it jeopardises my future here\056 I\220m sticking my head out for\nyou buddy\041 Anyways\054 the situation out here has gotten way worse\056\056\056 Remember\nmy little theory\077\077 Turns out I was right\056 Obviously\056 A little too right\056\056\056 Forget \nthe Wenoti arcade\054 our POI was just the first of a digital jailbreak\056 Countries all around the world have been contacting the etiNuxe Intelligence Agency with \nreports of video game characters disappearing from arcades without a trace\077\077\077\nThe Government doesn\220t want news of this getting out\056 Maybe they know something\077 Or its another way to get a quick buck\056 Either way\054 that\220s the real reason why EXUN got suspended\056 Don\220t listen to their fancy jargon\056\056\056\nThat\220s all from my end\056 Agents like us are being relocated\054 so I guess I better get packing\056 What are you going to do now\077\n)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 165 0 R
     /Pg 162 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
